## 5. How to Structure the Page Layout for Maximum Conversions

If you dump 12 prices on a single page linearly, leads will get analysis paralysis and leave. Lay the page out in **3 steps**:

1. **The Toggle Switch at the Top:** Put two tabs at the top of the pricing section:
* `[ 🏨 For Hotels & Resorts ]`  |  `[ 🔑 For Shortlets & Airbnbs ]`
* *(Both tabs show the exact same packages and prices, just with slightly tweaked bullet copy—e.g., "Room Inventory & Front Desk" swaps to "Multi-Apartment Calendar & Automated Check-In").*


2. **Split "One-Time Setups" vs. "Monthly Growth" Side-by-Side:** Let cash-rich buyers who hate monthly retainers buy the **₦420k–₦800k One-Time Systems** immediately, and let cash-flow buyers start with the **₦100k–₦270k Monthly Packages**.
3. **Two CTAs on Every Card:**
* Primary Button: **"Book This Package (Pay / Start Onboarding)"** -> Leads directly to your Form (#1).


* Secondary Button: **"Watch 2-Min Live Demo on WhatsApp"** -> Triggers your Follow-Up Bot (#14) to send a screen recording of the Booking Site, WhatsApp AI Bot, and HMS in action.





